{"ID":"20240118151136-3chw8sj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151136-3chw8sj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151136-3chw8sj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151136-tmx3bdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130215-1i4og6w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130215-1i4og6w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:359,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:359\u0026#125;","title":"184紫参","type":"doc","updated":"20240201100816"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151136-tmx3bdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151136-tmx3bdj","updated":"20240122130203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治心腹积聚，寒热邪气。通九窍，利大小便。治牛病。生山谷。一名牡蒙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130205-rteqyb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130205-rteqyb4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】珍珠菜之地下茎谓之紫参，多产于深山溪涧之旁，色紫黑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130206-t5r5xz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130206-t5r5xz3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130208-2i4sh2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130208-2i4sh2h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】紫参为破血通经要药，功能治心腹寒热积聚，产后恶露不行。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130209-fnceneg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130209-fnceneg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗肠胃大热，唾血衄血，肠中聚血，廱肿诸疮，止渴益精。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130210-rfgcaub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130210-rfgcaub"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治心腹坚胀，散瘀血，治妇人血闭不通。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130212-jjma07e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130212-jjma07e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】主狂疟温疟，鼽血，汗出，治血痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130213-10frq7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130213-10frq7z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130214-ciwnfdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130214-ciwnfdc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】畏辛夷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130203-lsg6meh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130203-lsg6meh"}},{"ID":"20240122130215-in76ov3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130215-in76ov3"}},{"ID":"20240122130215-1i4og6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130215-1i4og6w","updated":"20240201100816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一百八十四，紫参。张仲景有选用紫参，这个紫参呢，本经原文是治心腹积聚，寒热邪痛。你说这个老师很多都是心腹拘紧，寒热邪痛。所以我说，我们要参考这个经方，在金匮里面就可以看到，下利背痛。病人有下利的时候，腹痛，我们用紫参汤，紫参汤呢，不是单味紫参啊，是以紫参为主，这个药，他是为什么噢，你看，他是破血通经的药。《别录》就讲的很正确的，只要肠胃大热、破血，吐血出来，还有鼻子出血出来，都可以使用。那《甄权》呢，治心腹坚涨，善晕眩，这是妇人血闭不通，月经没有来，都可以使用这个紫参。那咳嗽、咳逆、下利肺痛，肺里面有淤血、有积血，统统可以使用紫参。紫参呢由于它性是寒凉的性，它不是温热的性，性是寒凉的性，所以说当你使用紫参的时候，要考虑到，病人如果是热症，紫参是完全对症的。病人如果是寒症，紫参不对症。所以，我们要知道药性的寒热，目的就在这里，只此而已。"}]}]}